# Optional. Defaults to /api/v1: Vite proxies it in development and, in production, the
# frontend host's rewrite in client/vercel.json forwards it to the backend (same origin, D69).
# Only set this if the API is on another origin; then also set COOKIE_SAME_SITE=none on the API.
# Example: https://api.example.com/api/v1
# Only public values belong here: anything VITE_* is bundled into the browser code.
# VITE_API_URL=
